{"version":1,"content":"<p>由視帝陳展鵬擔任主持的無綫台慶綜藝小王《弊傢伙！</p><p>有嘢唔見咗！</p><p>》，今晚（21日）進行錄影，藝人王祖藍、關心妍、黃劍文、及葉蒨文等擔任嘉賓。</p><p>展鵬坦言首次擔任節目主持心情緊張，他説：「乜嘢都試吓，好在祖藍喺度，一嚟化妝間已經同我度晒位，即刻定好多</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T13:23:57.066763+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T12:33:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T13:17:17.460778+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T13:17:17.460778+00:00","content_hash":"9876745f91843c270688c343d1cc6544c375b14c26662c7d31c1b5ddce2c98df","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}